    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Covert Ops Cell</strong></p><p><strong>“If you saw it happen, it wasn’t us.”</strong></p><p>Covert Ops cells make wars quiet. They prefer locks to speeches, shadows to banners, and results to credit. They don’t start fights—they rearrange the board so the fight never happens.</p><p><em>You’ve become legend. Not the comforting kind.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> The Adaptive Adversary Engine has difficulty tracking you. In Bunker Busters scenarios, there is a 50% chance its resource shifts to counter your Intrigue-focused actions fail.</li></ul>",
